OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA generally fine start to the
OL,6,Fday, cloud builds with the potential
OL,7,Ffor isolated, mostly light, showers to
OL,8,Fdevelop. Remaining breezy,
OL,9,Fparticularly around the coasts, easing
OL,10,Flater. Feeling cool.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FA fine and mostly dry evening
OL,13,Fwith easing winds. Perhaps the odd
OL,14,Fisolated light shower at first but
OL,15,Flargely clear skies developing towards
OL,16,Fdawn.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
