OL,3,GEast
OL,4,
OL,5,CSunday:FA sunny start to Sunday, with
OL,6,Flight winds and patchy fair weather
OL,7,Fcloud developing through the day.
OL,8,FBecoming cloudier overnight with rain
OL,9,Farriving later.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FRain
OL,12,Fand low cloud into Monday, heavy at
OL,13,Ftimes. Drier Monday afternoon with
OL,14,Ffurther rain Tuesday morning and a
OL,15,Fdeveloping moderate to fresh breeze.
OL,16,FDrier thereafter but remaining windy.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
